#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:194
#: 28285e5a89a040b59d3c1eecc0205327
msgid "Internal path (FiveAges robots)"
msgstr "内部路径（第五纪机器人）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:196
#: b1fe0d799fb747c68ec06c71808ae5f3
msgid ""
"FiveAges robots (W1, W2, W2R, S2, S2R, and the dual-arm CCS) use [fa-"
"deploy-ws](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-deploy-ws), default branch "
"`fa-w2`. W1, W2, and S2 URDF, plus the Gen1 and Gen2 USD remotes, are "
"public. W2R and S2R are not. The description map is [FiveAges robot "
"descriptions](../4-reference/descriptions/4-fiveages_umbrella.md)."
msgstr ""
"第五纪机器人（W1、W2、W2R、S2、S2R，以及双臂 CCS）使用 [fa-deploy-ws](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/fa-deploy-ws)，默认分支 `fa-w2`。W1、W2、S2 的 URDF，以及 Gen1、Gen2 的 "
"USD 远端，都是公开的。W2R 和 S2R 不是。描述对照见 "
"[第五纪机器人描述](../4-reference/descriptions/4-fiveages_umbrella.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:198
#: d52fec16bd36406dba29c39a83362f1f
msgid ""
"Open the checkout you were given and follow that repository’s README. The"
" script name shared with the public workspace is `./init_repo.sh`."
msgstr "打开分给你的检出，按那个仓库的 README 做。和公开工作区共用的脚本名是 `./init_repo.sh`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:200
#: cb8ed22063474cbb9169b6de6666f6e6
msgid ""
"GitHub hides a private repository from anyone without access. That does "
"not block every binary."
msgstr "没有权限时，GitHub 打不开私有仓库。这不妨碍你使用已经打进 deb 的程序。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:161
#: 9017a4c585824ec9aa33de8440f5a677
msgid "Use it for"
msgstr "用来做什么"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:161
#: 68d5ec55ca654f2093e77108ef27e3c7
msgid "The internal workspace (`fa-w2`)"
msgstr "内部工作区（`fa-w2`）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:161
#: 9927ac7431e34716a0ae8b2640335d95
msgid "Clone and follow its README"
msgstr "克隆后按它的 README 做"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:161
#: 4fabecbc28424ddab27d2db8f85aa68c 9f3be60411844eafaa7382e33de03465
msgid "Read or change that description"
msgstr "阅读或修改这份描述"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:161
#: 847ebfa3498647a98fc16d62e9d31a3a
msgid "Whole-body controller source"
msgstr "全身控制器源码"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:161
#: 94b06e731cff4247bc33967a86716338 e253be4a983848dd8678a10fd36703c7
msgid "Read or change the source"
msgstr "阅读或修改源码"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:161
#: 591a538a41024d91a6d409e6b17821e8
msgid "Wheeled-arm motion library source"
msgstr "轮臂运动库源码"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:210
#: 1427851209a040bcb3e5f765c0cb1842
msgid ""
"You can run whole-body control without those two source checkouts. The "
"standard GitHub Release package `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` already "
"contains `ocs2_wbc_controller`, `ocs2_humanoid`, and `lina_planning` "
"([arms deb notes](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/README.deb.md)). In `open-deploy-ws` or "
"`fa-deploy-ws`, choose `d` for arms in `./init_repo.sh`, or run "
"`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only arms`. The script installs that "
"standard package. It does not install `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control-full`,"
" and the package is not on Ubuntu or ROS apt. Private descriptions, other"
" hardware interfaces, and teleop trees are separate repositories. They "
"stay on the [Repository Map](3-repo_map.md). Public W1, W2, and S2 URDF "
"stays on [FiveAges robot "
"descriptions](../4-reference/descriptions/4-fiveages_umbrella.md)."
msgstr ""
"跑全身控制不必检出这两个源码仓。标准 GitHub Release 包 `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` 里已经有 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`、`ocs2_humanoid` 和 `lina_planning`（[arms 的 deb "
"说明](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/README.deb.md)）。在 `open-deploy-ws` 或 `fa-"
"deploy-ws` 里，`./init_repo.sh` 给 arms 选 `d`，或运行 "
"`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only arms`。脚本装的是这个标准包，不会装 `ros-jazzy-"
"arms-ros2-control-full`，也不在 Ubuntu 或 ROS 的 apt "
"源里。私有描述、其他驱动层和遥操作仓是另外的仓库，仍列在 [仓库地图](3-repo_map.md)。公开的 W1、W2、S2 URDF 见 "
"[第五纪机器人描述](../4-reference/descriptions/4-fiveages_umbrella.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:214
#: 513082baf9c84625b3f09956585ebfa6
msgid ""
"Open [fa-deploy-ws](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-deploy-ws) and run"
" the init and quick-start scripts named in that README."
msgstr ""
"打开 [fa-deploy-ws](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-deploy-ws)，运行该 "
"README 里写的初始化和快速启动脚本。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:217
#: 9ba7b3206e4a4e009fc3ef6447caf7a1
msgid ""
"**Safety:** Prove the motion in `mock_components`, or in the sim path "
"that workspace documents, before you set `hardware:=real`."
msgstr "**安全：** 先在 `mock_components`，或该工作区文档里的仿真路径上把动作跑通，再设 `hardware:=real`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:219
#: 791cf8878e0e4f179244d658c9c2e3cf
msgid "Day 7: Bring one new robot into FaSim"
msgstr "第 7 天：把一台新机器人接入 FaSim"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:221
#: c0f1e41fd758434a8fda2422bcae357e
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Connect a robot that is not already a demo, so Isaac and the "
"ROS 2 stack move it. You are done when a command moves that robot’s "
"joints in the viewport. Replaying CR5 or W2 is practice, not the task."
msgstr ""
"**目标：** 接上一台还不是现成 demo 的机器人，让 Isaac 和 ROS 2 "
"运控把它动起来。一条指令能在视口里带动这台机器人的关节，这一天就算完成。再跑一遍 CR5 或 W2 只是练习，不是任务。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:223
#: 58b34c828e95465a8a6e1a4d312a88de
msgid ""
"**Before you start.** Finish Days 0–3. You can reach HOLD with "
"`hardware:=mock_components`, Isaac Sim is installed, `ISAACSIM_DIR` is "
"set, and you have run FaSim `./init.sh` and `./run.sh`."
msgstr ""
"**开始之前。** 做完第 0 到第 3 天。你能用 `hardware:=mock_components` 进到 HOLD，Isaac Sim "
"已安装，`ISAACSIM_DIR` 已设置，并且跑过 FaSim 的 `./init.sh` 和 `./run.sh`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:225
#: 93c647e5b96b4183b8c866ab8d8ae684
msgid ""
"File layout: [Add a Robot](../2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md). "
"Starting Isaac and choosing a connection: [Isaac "
"Sim](../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md). What the two connections "
"do: [FaSim-Isaac](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md)."
msgstr ""
"文件怎么放：[添加机器人](../2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md)。怎么启动 "
"Isaac、选哪一种连接：[Isaac "
"Sim](../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)。两种连接各自做什么：[FaSim-"
"Isaac](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:227
#: d569ef5e0f6c44ca96922e076ca866f3
msgid "Build these four pieces"
msgstr "准备这四样"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:229
#: d4ee0fb8e60548db8a95e57ca836f1d8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**A description.** Add a `{robot}_description` package whose xacro "
"includes a `ros2_control` block. Simulation plugins come from "
"[`simulation_hardware.xacro`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/xacro/ros2_control/simulation_hardware.xacro)."
" Before you open Isaac, `ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py "
"robot:=<key>` reaches HOLD. Leave `hardware` at the default."
msgstr ""
"**描述包。** 增加 `{robot}_description`，xacro 里要有 `ros2_control` 块。仿真插件来自 "
"[`simulation_hardware.xacro`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/xacro/ros2_control/simulation_hardware.xacro)。打开"
" Isaac 之前，`ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=<key>` "
"应能进到 HOLD。`hardware` 保持默认。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:231
#: 4c640ef67d5c4bdf80b90a5e59b4077d
msgid ""
"**A USD stage.** `./run.sh` opens it, and the stage has one "
"ArticulationRoot for this robot. Put it under "
"[robot_usds](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds), or in a project"
" scene you can open. There is no `./run.sh --robot`."
msgstr ""
"**一份 USD。** `./run.sh` 能打开它，舞台上这台机器人有一个 ArticulationRoot。放在 "
"[robot_usds](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds) "
"下，或放进你能打开的项目场景。没有 `./run.sh --robot`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:233
#: 5817667b8ec24716817910653371b451
msgid "**One connection for those joints.**"
msgstr "**给这些关节接上一种连接。**"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:234
#: 4f301263c6974adbaf7c1030be00cb52
msgid ""
"**Topic bridge.** `hardware:=isaac` uses "
"`topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem`. The xacro "
"`joint_commands_topic` / `joint_states_topic` and the graph `topicName` "
"are the same strings. The shared macro writes `/isaac/joint_command` and "
"`/isaac/joint_states`. W2’s topic-bridge payload uses `/joint_command` "
"and `/joint_states`. `demo.launch.py` has no namespace argument."
msgstr ""
"**话题桥。** `hardware:=isaac` 使用 "
"`topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem`。xacro 的 "
"`joint_commands_topic` / `joint_states_topic` 和图里的 `topicName` "
"是同一组字符串。共享宏写成 `/isaac/joint_command` 和 `/isaac/joint_states`。W2 的话题桥载荷用的是"
" `/joint_command` 和 `/joint_states`。`demo.launch.py` 没有 namespace 参数。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:235
#: 9f36513836e24ad2b34ecc4588f669d5
msgid ""
"**In-process.** Press Play on a payload that contains "
"`ROS2ControlLaunch`. W2’s in-process payload is "
"[`fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2-robot-"
"usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda). The node sets "
"`hardware=isaac_sim` and `isaac_prim_path`. The description xacro must "
"accept `isaac_sim`."
msgstr ""
"**进程内。** 对含有 `ROS2ControlLaunch` 的载荷按 Play。W2 的进程内载荷是 "
"[`fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2-robot-"
"usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda)。节点会设置 `hardware=isaac_sim` "
"和 `isaac_prim_path`。描述 xacro 必须接受 `isaac_sim`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:237
#: 08f093d4481644c7a0b16e6749594309
msgid ""
"**Controllers that match the body.** An arm, or a split-body robot, uses "
"`ocs2_arm_controller` (`demo` or `split_body`). A planner model that "
"includes the mobile base uses `full_body.launch.py` and "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`. That controller is already in the `ros-jazzy-arms-"
"ros2-control` deb from Day 6. Cloning [ocs2-wbc-"
"controller](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ocs2-wbc-controller) is how "
"you read or edit the source. Leave `infoFile` empty to keep the "
"description default. Lock a mobile base with the `mobile_base_tcp` info "
"file and `BASE_LOCK`. `full_body` together with a `fixed_base` info file "
"has no virtual chassis joint for that lock, and arm enable can stay in "
"`WAITING_FOR_ENABLE_POLICY`."
msgstr ""
"**控制器跟身体对得上。** 机械臂或分体机器人用 `ocs2_arm_controller`（`demo` 或 "
"`split_body`）。规划模型里包含移动底盘时，用 `full_body.launch.py` 和 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`。这个控制器已经在第六天的 `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` deb 里。克隆"
" [ocs2-wbc-controller](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ocs2-wbc-"
"controller) 是为了读源码或改源码。`infoFile` 留空，就用描述包的默认 info。锁住移动底盘时用 "
"`mobile_base_tcp` 这份 info，并发送 `BASE_LOCK`。`full_body` 再配一份 `fixed_base` "
"info 时，没有这把锁能用的虚拟底盘关节，手臂使能会停在 `WAITING_FOR_ENABLE_POLICY`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:239
#: 4a096772ea7d480bb5f33460e6ea1a3b
msgid "Work in this order"
msgstr "按这个顺序做"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:241
#: 9ca0d9ad79ec40b1ab87b14bbf3bd0dc
msgid ""
"In mock, the launch above reaches HOLD, and the joint names match the "
"xacro."
msgstr "在 mock 里，上面的 launch 能进到 HOLD，关节名和 xacro 一致。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:242
#: e471bdf2277b4e40b3c08e5b7b271ca3
msgid "Run `./run.sh`, open your USD, and press Play so physics runs."
msgstr "运行 `./run.sh`，打开你的 USD，按 Play，让物理开始跑。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:243
#: da3f1b3fb5334a1c885bdea7894f8936
msgid ""
"Connect with the topic bridge or the in-process graph. Read the joint-"
"state topic with `ros2 topic echo`, or run `ros2 control "
"list_controllers`."
msgstr ""
"用话题桥或进程内的图接上。用 `ros2 topic echo` 看关节状态话题，或运行 `ros2 control "
"list_controllers`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:244
#: 19bd634df45942d2a25479c591a288c4
msgid ""
"Send a small joint target. The same joints move in Isaac. On the in-"
"process graph, `ros2 topic hz /clock` follows the physics step."
msgstr "发一个小的关节目标。Isaac 里同一组关节会动。进程内的图上，`ros2 topic hz /clock` 跟着物理步走。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:248
#: e7e45de1031249daaf44cc0d09327bea
msgid "The description package, or the branch, and the USD path you opened."
msgstr "描述包或分支，以及你打开的 USD 路径。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:249
#: a6b83566fb7444edbb19a6044cacbc6a
msgid "The launch line, or the `ROS2ControlLaunch` prim you played."
msgstr "launch 命令，或你播放的那个 `ROS2ControlLaunch` 图元。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:250
#: 80628069538945d0ae80776fbd3b996b
msgid "The joint-state topic or the controller list, and the motion you sent."
msgstr "你看到的关节状态话题或控制器列表，以及你发出的动作。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:252
#: 94a7b25435244fd7a598009356f5aeaf
msgid "How you know it works"
msgstr "怎样算做完"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:254
#: d55b318fc9df419c94a0836212d39c9e
msgid ""
"Check joint control, base motion, the end effector, and sensor data "
"against the robot you chose."
msgstr "按你选的这台机器人，核对关节控制、底盘运动、末端执行器和传感器数据。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:256
#: 16d92b16311d40a6a399b11fa3f13d4e
msgid ""
"**Joints.** Mock reaches HOLD, Play runs, and the joint names in the "
"state topic or in `ros2 control list_controllers` match the xacro. A "
"command moves those joints in the viewport. On an in-process graph, "
"`/robot_description` comes from `robot_state_publisher`, and the "
"controller manager starts with robot-description publishing turned off."
msgstr ""
"**关节。** mock 能进到 HOLD，Play 在跑，状态话题或 `ros2 control list_controllers` "
"里的关节名和 xacro 一致。发一条指令后，视口里这些关节会动。进程内的图上，`/robot_description` 来自 "
"`robot_state_publisher`，控制器管理器启动时不再自己发布机器人描述。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:258
#: 5c7365d60a094b7eab19f5ef33e602b8
msgid ""
"**Base.** Isaac publishes `world → odom → base_*`. "
"`robot_state_publisher` publishes the URDF tree, including "
"`base_footprint → base_link` when both links exist. OCS2 `baseFrame` is "
"that same link. One node publishes each TF edge. A ROS namespace does not"
" rename `frame_id`. A base that drives on a map uses `NavigationLaunch` "
"on the USD. `map` is a path relative to the opened `env/` layer, and the "
"node starts `navigation_isaac_gt.launch.py`. Composer `ros2-stack` is a "
"separate process on the host."
msgstr ""
"**底盘。** Isaac 发布 `world → odom → base_*`。`robot_state_publisher` 发布 URDF "
"树；两根连杆都在时，其中包含 `base_footprint → base_link`。OCS2 的 `baseFrame` 就是这根连杆。一条 "
"TF 边只由一个节点发布。ROS 命名空间不会改 `frame_id`。底盘要在地图上走时，USD 上放 "
"`NavigationLaunch`。`map` 是相对已打开 `env/` 层的路径，节点启动的是 "
"`navigation_isaac_gt.launch.py`。composer 的 `ros2-stack` 是主机上的另一个进程。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:260
#: fe2a8e0178aa4966ae18d801deb21210
msgid ""
"**End effector.** The launch arguments `type`, `left_type`, or "
"`right_type` name this gripper or hand, and you can see it open or close."
" There is no `gripper:=` argument."
msgstr ""
"**末端。** launch 参数 `type`、`left_type` 或 `right_type` 对上这只夹爪或手，能看见它张开或闭合。没有"
" `gripper:=` 参数。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:262
#: b6e4f6aef2c149cc98b4fdc73b741834
msgid ""
"**Sensors.** While Play is running, the camera or lidar topics from the "
"scene are publishing. Camera rigs stay on the scene USD."
msgstr "**传感器。** Play 期间，场景里的相机或雷达话题在发数据。相机装在场景 USD 上。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:264
#: 717ac2977e3e45a3b76f05e00aa4bb19
msgid ""
"**A second robot on the same stage.** Each ArticulationRoot has its own "
"graph and its own `ROS2ControlLaunch` `namespace`. Topics live under "
"`/<ns>/`. Frame names stay `world`, `odom`, and `base_link`."
msgstr ""
"**同一场景里的第二台机器人。** 每个 ArticulationRoot 有自己的图，也有自己的 `ROS2ControlLaunch` "
"`namespace`。话题在 `/<ns>/` 下。坐标系名仍是 `world`、`odom` 和 `base_link`。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:266
#: 411f3100092e4a7c8e8994669fe15363
msgid ""
"A motion that finishes much too fast is a `/clock` problem. The in-"
"process W2 payload takes the clock from the physics step. The topic-"
"bridge payload still takes it from the playback tick. The [FaSim "
"reference](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md) describes that "
"clock. Changing joint gains does not fix it."
msgstr ""
"动作结束得特别快，是 `/clock` 的问题。进程内的 W2 载荷从物理步取时钟。话题桥载荷仍从播放节拍取时钟。[FaSim "
"参考](../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md) 写了这个时钟。改关节增益修不好。"

